-              MOVE "VALID" TO WS-STATUS
-              MOVE "REFUND: NEGATIVE AMOUNT ALLOWED BY DESIGN"
-                  TO WS-REASON
-          ELSE
-              IF TRAN-AMT < 0
-                  MOVE "REJECTED" TO WS-STATUS
-                  MOVE "NON-REFUND: NEGATIVE AMOUNT NOT ALLOWED"
